---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About David Glass" description="Learn about David Glass: A life of service in Bastrop County, his business experience, and his vision for Precinct 4.">
  
  <!-- Page Header with Portrait -->
  <section class="page-header-gradient pt-28 pb-20 relative">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="gold-line mb-6"></div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
            About David Glass
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl font-sans font-light text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            A lifelong resident, business owner, and community leader dedicated to protecting the future of Bastrop County.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:flex justify-end">
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 w-full h-full border-2 border-gold/20 rounded-2xl"></div>
            <img 
              src="/david-glass-headshot-dark.jpg" 
              alt="David Glass" 
              class="relative z-10 w-80 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover aspect-[3/4]"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bio Section -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-6">Rooted in Bastrop County</h2>
          <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-near-black mb-6 font-sans">
            David Glass is a 40-year successful businessman who has built and operated multiple businesses right here in Bastrop County. His connection to this land and its communities is not a talking point; it is a defining characteristic of his life and career. As a business owner, rancher, and community leader for more than four decades, he understands what it takes to manage growth without losing what makes this place home.
          </p>
          <p class="text-near-black/70 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            David serves on many boards of successful entities across the county and region. He knows what it means to sign a paycheck, balance a complex budget, and be accountable for outcomes. He brought that exact same operational rigor to Bastrop County government.
          </p>
          <p class="text-near-black/70 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            He also worked to help create the ESD 3 Ambulance Service, the first ambulance service in the County of Bastrop. That kind of initiative defines who David is: he sees what a community needs and works to make it happen.
          </p>
          <p class="text-near-black/70 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            He serves as County Commissioner not to be a politician, but to be a steward. Bastrop County is growing rapidly, and the challenges we face with traffic, water security, and development require a leader who plans for the future while protecting our past.
          </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-divider my-16"></div>

      <!-- Leadership Timeline -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="gold-line mb-6"></div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-4">Leadership Across the County</h2>
        <p class="text-near-black/70 leading-relaxed mb-10 font-sans">
          David's commitment to Bastrop County extends far beyond the Commissioner's Court. Over the years, he has taken on demanding roles to ensure the fundamental systems that keep our communities running are strong.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-6 reveal-stagger">
        <!-- Role 1 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">County Commissioner, Precinct 4</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Managing infrastructure, the county road system, and the Precinct 4 budget for Elgin and rural eastern Bastrop County.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 2 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">President, Aqua Water Supply Corporation</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Overseeing critical water infrastructure that provides clean, reliable water to thousands of Bastrop County residents.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 3 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Board Member, Bastrop County Appraisal District</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Ensuring fair, transparent, and accurate property valuations for every taxpayer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 4 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Former President, Elgin Economic Development Corporation</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Guiding economic growth to bring responsible businesses and jobs to the local community.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 5 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Austin Community College Foundation Board</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Served on the ACC Foundation Board for many years, supporting workforce development and educational opportunity across the region.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Role 6 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">ACC $400 Million Bond Selection &amp; Oversight Committee</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Served on the selection and oversight committee for Austin Community College's roughly $400 million bond program, ensuring responsible stewardship of taxpayer investment in education.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 7 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l5.447 2.724A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Vice Chair, CAPCOG (TxDOT)</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Served as Vice Chair of the Capital Area Council of Governments, working with TxDOT on regional transportation planning and infrastructure priorities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 8 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Champion, ESD 3 Ambulance Service</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">A driving force on the Commissioner's Court supporting the creation of the first ambulance service in Bastrop County, bringing life-saving emergency medical response to rural communities that had none.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 7 -->
        <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-warm-gray hover-lift group flex items-start gap-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-gold transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.141 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.858 15.355-5.858 21.213 0" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-1">Court Liaison, Broadband Committee</h3>
            <p class="text-near-black/70 font-sans text-sm">Served as the Commissioner's Court liaison to the Broadband Committee that was awarded a $54 million grant to install fiber throughout Bastrop County, connecting rural communities to high-speed internet.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-divider my-16"></div>

      <!-- Personal Section -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="gold-line mb-6"></div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-navy mb-6">A Personal Stake</h2>
          <p class="text-near-black leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            David's stake in Bastrop County is deeply personal. He and his wife have been married for over 40 years. They raised four successful children right here in Bastrop County through Elgin ISD, and are now proudly watching their six grandchildren grow up in the same vibrant community.
          </p>
          <p class="text-near-black/70 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            When he is not reviewing county budgets or checking on road projects, David is working his own land. His background in ranching and farming keeps him grounded in the realities of rural life, the lifeblood of our county's identity.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-full h-full border-2 border-gold/20 rounded-2xl"></div>
          <img src="/david-glass-cowboy.jpg" alt="David Glass on his property in Bastrop County" class="relative z-10 w-full rounded-2xl shadow-xl object-cover aspect-[4/3]" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Commitment Quote Block -->
      <div class="page-header-gradient text-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl mt-16 text-center reveal">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold/40 mx-auto mb-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10H14.017zM0 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10H0z"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif italic text-white/80 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            "I will continue to bring business sense, transparency, and hard work to the Commissioner's Court. Bastrop County is our home, and I intend to keep it a place we are all proud of."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
